    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located in the peaceful townland of Arderawinny, just 6km west of Schull village, this charming traditional farmhouse enjoys a private and sheltered setting on approximately 1.2 acres with beautiful sea views westwards across Dunmanus Bay. \r\nThis character-filled property comprises a beautifully maintained two-bedroom farmhouse together with outbuildings and a separate guest annex, offering excellent flexibility for extended family, guest accommodation or working from home.\r\nThe farmhouse has been lovingly renovated and carefully maintained over the years, successfully retaining its traditional charm and many original features while providing comfortable living accommodation throughout. There is a warmth and authenticity to this home. The orientation along the north–south–east–west axis allows for beautiful sunset views every evening throughout the year, depending on weather conditions.\r\nThe gardens are a special feature of the property and will delight any gardening enthusiast. Rich in maturity and biodiversity, the grounds contain an impressive collection of specimen trees including wild cherry, hornbeam, oak, wild pear, mountain ash, sweet chestnut, mature hawthorn, beech and alder, among many others. Carefully planted and nurtured, the gardens provide year-round colour, shelter and privacy. In addition, there is a dedicated area for growing your own produce.\r\nCombining traditional character, beautiful mature gardens and a very attractive location close to Schull and the coastline, this is an exciting opportunity for West Cork house hunters.\r\n\r\nServices: \r\nGas central heating along with stoves and an open fire\r\nPrivate water and septic system \r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
